{
  "_doc": "Master -> app imageset map for the vertical slice (tools/assets/integrate.py). `master` is an art folder under design/art (the lock-light re-lock wins, then .png, then .webp). target `games` writes a flat PNG into PofuGames/Resources at `scale` px per point, fitted into `points` and never upscaled; target `world` names an imageset baked into World.xcassets by design/prototypes/interactions/tools/preblur.py (integrate.py runs it, then checks the imageset exists). target `ui` is the same flat bake into PofuDesignSystem/Resources (the painted menu art, named paint-*; PofuPaint in the design system lists them). target `glow` bakes an additive glow on black (a Codex glow-* sprite) into World.xcassets as a white-on-alpha imageset named by `name` (alpha is the brightest channel), fitted into `points` at `scale`; the app tints it per source and adds it. target `sprite` bakes a coloured alpha sprite (optionally one `cell` of a sheet, `alpha_floor` clearing the halation round it) into World.xcassets for screen-space drawing (the fireflies); `shield` bakes a cell of a sheet as a square PNG for the shield extension and its replica; `app` bakes a plate into the app's own catalog as a @3x imageset (the launch sky, restored to `size`, and the cloud curtain), with harmony's correction. target `fx` bakes a light-on-black exploration take (batch 44) as alpha (`colour` keeps hue; else white to tint) into World.xcassets under the hook name the code asks for (world-fog-card-N, world-rain-tile, ...), stretched to `canvas` or fitted into `points`, `tile` making a wrap-around tile; target `icons-duo` slices the two-tone icon sheet (`grid`, `index`) into flat paint-duo-* PNGs for PofuPaint; both name their exploration take in `source`. `postcard` entries take a gate master (`master`, restored to `size`) or an exploration take (`source`).",
  "targets": {
    "games": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuGames/Resources",
    "world": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuWorld/Resources/World.xcassets",
    "ui": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuDesignSystem/Resources",
    "glow": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuWorld/Resources/World.xcassets",
    "sprite": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuWorld/Resources/World.xcassets",
    "shield": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuCompanion/Resources",
    "app": "App/Resources/Assets.xcassets",
    "postcard": "App/Resources/Assets.xcassets",
    "shield-icons": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuCompanion/Resources",
    "fx": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuWorld/Resources/World.xcassets",
    "icons-duo": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuDesignSystem/Resources",
    "kit": "Packages/PofuKit/Sources/PofuDesignSystem/Resources"
  },
